graph TD
    A([Start: Select Model]) --> B{Data Size}
    B -->|Small| C[XGBoost]
    B -->|Large| D{Load Profile Type}
    D -->|Smooth; Periodic| E{Compute Budget}
    D -->|Irregular; Spiky| C
